# phone_model.pins , the model the PHONE runs, pinned like the box's weights (same format as
# model.pins: name sha256 bytes upstream). Kept apart from model.pins on purpose: setup_llama.sh
# fetches and stages every model.pins entry onto the volume for the box's own llama-server, and
# the phone's model belongs in the unencrypted catalogue secd serves to phones instead
# (/var/lib/ghost/models, tools/phone_model.sh).
#
# Gemma 4 E2B, instruction-tuned, quantisation-aware trained for 2-bit (Unsloth's QAT mobile build,
# Apache 2.0, no account, no token): ~2.3B effective parameters, text only here (no mmproj).
#   https://huggingface.co/unsloth/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-mobile-GGUF
# Hash and size from Hugging Face's LFS listing (api/models/.../tree/main, lfs.oid), 2026-09-27.
#
# name  sha256  bytes  upstream
gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-UD-Q2_K_XL.gguf  0a5bbc20f91f92da96ab4870fa71b356c45b8500a7b8b9c3e0eb48359b72da28  2186186784  https://huggingface.co/unsloth/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-mobile-GGUF/resolve/main/gemma-4-E2B-it-qat-UD-Q2_K_XL.gguf
